"""Token-local frame, image and game detector with an 'ame' spelling echo.

The largest responses are for frame(s) and DataFrame. Smaller responses
recognize related programming words, image/game words, frame's rhymes,
and literal am/rame fragments. Some Chinese and Japanese spellings are
included. Values approximate training averages, not general meanings.
