"""Detect opening curly-braced groups, particularly TeX indices and powers.

Underscore/caret plus an opening brace gives a strong positive activation,
whether joined in one token or split across tokens. Other punctuation joined
to an opening brace is weaker. TeX reference/environment arguments are
negative; font and accent arguments are mildly positive. Other text is zero.
The small, token-specific background responses are not modeled.
